      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i get it. honestly urgen care is like $150 just for a walk in which is crazy. my friend said i could just take some benadryl or something instead to help me sleep through the cough? i think that's safer since it's just an antihistamine. is that cool to mix with the zoloft?",
